{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_shwaz_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_shwaz_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"普通的一天","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_shwaz_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"0849dfdd57725d166fc3100d16ecc4285e12c7012e971c2376aa6a8aa7bba094","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请用茶，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，过了明天，又要有一段时间喝不到你泡的红茶了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我完成本年度的教官任务后，我会申请调岗的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种时候，你就应该说“既然大小姐这么希望的话，那我就不回去了”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，那我待会儿就递交离职申请。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那还是算了。你真的辞职的话，我可要被本舰的人记恨死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我该去办事处了。我记得你白天在治安局对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，查理最近因为一群流寇的事情忙得不可开交，托我帮他带一带新人，我等会儿就过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就晚上见吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上六点，“纯白火山”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"黑，你现在有空吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查理找我，不过还有点时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"锡兰的事情，我想问问你的意见，我在“纯白火山”等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间过得真快啊，黑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很久以前，我和芭芭拉也常来这样的餐吧消磨时光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您从没说过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多事情在心里藏久了，就没了说出来的欲望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我居然让我的女儿从其他人那里听说她母亲的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想和小姐聊聊夫人的事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生日派对是个不错的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只怕，我愿意说，她不愿意听了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐会听的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您只需要做好心理准备，同时承受她的怨气就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈，说得也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我该多做一些准备，多告诉她一些她母亲的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了。大概是66年的时候，那年，维多利亚把议会里的所有人都搞得焦头烂额。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芭芭拉那时候就在火山上做研究了，那里没有信号，无法随时保持联络。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结婚纪念日那天，我们约好，我去火山脚下接她，然后我们一起去餐厅吃饭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果，那天我临时有一个脱不开身的政府会议要参加。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼的声音","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我赶到火山脚下的时候，天已经暗下来了，预订好的餐厅用餐时间也错过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼的声音","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当时很沮丧，觉得一切都完了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）嘿，笨蛋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她没有生气，反而安慰我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当我在夕阳下，看着她的侧脸时，我忽然像是得到了上天的指引一样——在路边摘了几朵花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，不是火山预警花，就是那种，在火山脚下随处可见的花朵。"},{"type":"narration","text":"赫尔曼说着，拿起餐桌上插在水杯中的装饰花，像是身临其境一般，递向身边的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把花朵插在她的发梢，然后向她递出了求婚戒指。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得这段往事怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服务生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，市长先生，谢谢您的花......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？黑呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服务生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"不太清楚，我也是听到动静才从后厨出来看一看的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放开我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你的钱包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么——？！这个可恶的小鬼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"跟我过来，我要带你去治安局！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我不去，放开我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把他交给我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她就是治安局的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你、您是赫尔曼市长？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，交给这位小姐吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生都这么说了，我当然相信您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以走了，小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不打算抓我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想被我抓去治安局吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"不想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次再被我抓到，我会带你去比治安局更可怕的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼，别以为我会被你唬住。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么放过他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的脚上有些矿灰，他的衣服也不像是他自己的衣服......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我刚才抓住他的时候，在他的身上看到了一些源石结晶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是，他可能和私挖黑曜石的工人有关？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，那不是更该交给治安局？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查理知道怎么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他未必知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回来之后，我去过一趟治安局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得查理做得不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我走之前对他的交代他都完成得还不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但有些事情，当时的我也没想到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在还来得及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐和我提过一位佩利佩先生的事情，我想见一见他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"私挖黑曜石的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你找错人了，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火山都喷发了，现在还有谁会反对市长当时的决策？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都接受啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火山刚刚喷发完，对某些人来说，这是最好的发财机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怀疑他们买通了一些私挖黑曜石的工人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我不告诉你，是不是就轮到我大祸临头了，前治安局局长，黑女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我会自己找。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"头儿，按照你的要求，我让新人们换上了矿工的装备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在开始，忘了你们是治安局的人，你们只是一群打算去火山上冒险的矿工。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工们？","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"头儿，你打算让他们装成矿工引出那群流寇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我打算让他们真的去学习矿工们是怎么生活的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能引出那群流寇最好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"我能问问为什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有让他们理解私挖黑曜石的人都在干什么，他们才能在未来真正地解决这个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......锡兰大小姐的意思吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这确实像是小姐会说的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这是我的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了，我也去换一套衣服吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，路上再换。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我答应过那位锡兰小姐，在她想做事的时候，会帮她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在看来，帮你也是一样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交给我吧，我来帮你们牵线。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g11_volcanomountainside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"你们就是新来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"小孩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"对我尊重一点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"没我带路，你们别想找到黑曜石！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"抱、抱歉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你们又是为什么冒着这么大的风险来挖矿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"佩利佩那个老头给我们找的工作实在赚不了多少钱，我们是真的缺钱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，赫尔曼那个老头子也真是糊涂，放着这么一座金山不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"都知道规矩吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，绝对不泄密，绝对不怕死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，我们可不像佩利佩那么假惺惺，只要你有矿，我们就给你钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我来吧，下面还有许多你们的同伴呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"你们就在这里好好工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男孩消失在山洞的深处，浑然不知，在他的身后，有一双眼睛在盯着他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看门的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"情况怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"新来的这批看起来都挺强壮的，应该能挖不少黑曜石出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看门的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"不错，进去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看门的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看门的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么感觉有什么东西过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看门的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，这种地方怎么可能有其他人来，多半是错觉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）和预想的差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）营地显然是火山爆发后建成的，能在短时间内找到这么深的地方，对方恐怕早就渗透进了矿工群体中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）人数在二十个左右。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）那个孩子......应该就在前面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"听说你今天去了城里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你怎么知道的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我应该告诉过你，不要随便进城，也不要引人注目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"你们又不给我钱，又不让我出去透透气，我快要闷死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你知不知道你差点被这座城市最危险的家伙抓到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道她发什么疯，居然把你放了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"那个女人很危险吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你以为我们为什么躲在这种地方，就是怕触了那尊瘟神的霉头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"还有罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好该赚的也赚得差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"传下去，让兄弟们准备卸货。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊！终于要走了，我都要被这鬼地方热死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"卸货......是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你要成为我们的一员，确实也该告诉你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"卸货的意思，就是杀了下面那群矿工，然后带着黑曜石和钱走人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么要杀了他们？下面还有一批新人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"那就算他们倒霉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的想干这一行，这就是你必须要上的一课——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"永远不要留下后患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"他们见过你，你见过我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，如果你不想被我们杀死，你想成为我们的一员——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"那他们就得死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"别忘了是谁在你父母死后把你从矿洞里拉出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己说过的，你不想像你父母那样赚一辈子辛苦钱，你想赚大钱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了吗？明白了的话，给我一个准确的答复！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你是之前的那个——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，再次见面时，我会带你去比治安局更恐怖的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不想杀那些矿工！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"他们都和我爸妈一样！我、我吓他们只是好玩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的时间......是下午三点二十。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果抓紧时间的话，说不定还有机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把你的眼睛闭上，小鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来会发生的事情，对你来说不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"没等男孩反应过来，黑已经来到他的身边，将他击晕，然后扛在肩膀上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是这样更快一点。"},{"type":"narration","text":"远处接连响起一些惨叫，那是她事先设好的陷阱。但更多的，是逐渐逼近的脚步声。\n这让她想起了独自一人歼灭仇家的那一夜。\n那时候，她也是孤身一人，面对着数十倍的敌人。\n她想，如果是那时的自己，身边有这样一个孩子，她大概是不会做那样的事的。\n但现在，她觉得这样是理所当然的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g11_volcanomountainside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您居然真的一个人就把这群流寇给端了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经和查理说过了，你们分两队：一队清扫流寇的窝点，一队安抚受惊的其他矿工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"是！我们这就去办！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"还有什么命令？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把这个孩子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个孩子得了矿石病吧，先让我检查一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里比较平整，把他平放在这里吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，你怎么来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是佩利佩先生放心不下，给我打了个电话，我恐怕还要被蒙在鼓里呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我一个人能解决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"病情蔓延得还不算快，应该是最近才染上病的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能把这孩子送去罗德岛的办事处吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个孩子是怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是某对私挖黑曜石的矿工夫妻的孩子，他的父母因为矿难去世了，他无依无靠的，就被那些流寇给盯上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"流寇们最喜欢吸收这种孩子成为他们的一员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在罗德岛上也听过不少这样的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的性格很顽劣，恐怕短时间内是无法转变的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你打算怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想把他托付给罗德岛在汐斯塔的办事处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救治矿石病人本来就是我们的责任，更何况他还失去了父母。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，这件事就交给罗德岛办事处这边安排吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，现在公事算是解决了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"锡兰说着，拍了一下手掌，脸上露出笑容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没受伤吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，一群流寇而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才那个孩子，我发现他没有受伤，是你救下来的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是因为顾虑到这个孩子，你应该能用更少的时间解决里面的流寇吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概......能节省至少十分钟吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的话，或许赶得上你的生日派对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，我又不会真的因为这种事责怪你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，其实我很高兴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道以前的你是什么样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我花了很长时间适应你的那一面，就像你其实也花了许多时间适应和我一起生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们为对方改变了一些，但也迁就了一些对方固执的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如我对矿石病的执着，比如你做事的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望你能回新汐斯塔，但我心里其实又有些害怕。我怕等我们真的一起工作时，反而会有冲突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，现在确实不会了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会等你回来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在是五点半，从这里到“纯白火山”的车程，至少也要一个小时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的生日派对算是泡汤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......老爷现在应该正在“纯白火山”等着给你一个惊喜，现在过去还来得及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他让我等了这么久，现在等我一会儿也没什么关系吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的礼物呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不允许你用什么来不及去取之类的借口蒙混过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她看着自家大小姐的目光，难得有些窘迫。\n这就是锡兰的性格，想要什么，就会去争取。\n她当然准备了礼物，现在它大概还躺在商业街的那家首饰店里。\n现在开车过去取，然后再去“纯白火山”，应该还来得及。\n她正想这么说，但这时，她看到落日的余晖洒在了锡兰的侧脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，黑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......花？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别动，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来给你戴上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你准备的生日礼物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火山脚下的野花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然没有火山预警花那样的意义，但是，能够在火山脚下盛开，本来就代表着坚韧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而火山是汐斯塔的代表，站在这里，能够把新旧汐斯塔的风景都尽收眼底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并且，普通的野花，还可以有一层含义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都是生活在火山脚下的普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最重要的是——这些花还挺漂亮的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，这次就这么放过你好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"据说，老爷就是这样挽回了一次和夫人的婚姻危机的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的假的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈那时候，一定和我想到了一样的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以去向老爷求证一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑，你最近很帮他说话嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷也等了一段时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道啦，我会和他聊一聊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我还没吃饭呢，饿死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天你没什么事情吧？我来帮你收拾行李，顺便帮我给本舰的一些朋友带点礼物过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说起来，你挑的蛋糕是什么口味？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巧克力榛子，你上周说想吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是黑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿——阿嚏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服务生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，市长先生，怎么只有您一个人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服务生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"现在不该是锡兰小姐的生日派对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑那边出了点状况，我女儿先去了她那边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服务生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"噢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服务生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"您不过去没关系吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我知道的时候，黑已经把事情解决了，锡兰人也在那边了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也只能在这里等她们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服务生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"两位小姐没事就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服务生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，您手里的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我今天特意去火山脚下采的一束野花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服务生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，难怪我觉得那么眼熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经，我就是用这些花化解了我的婚姻危机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，希望它们也能化解一些我和女儿之间的隔阂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服务生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"您准备得这么充分，为什么我觉得您还是有点愁眉苦脸的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在刚才忽然有一种感觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感觉我准备的这招......不管用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
